# Override the auto-detected backend URL for this dev machine, if needed
# (e.g. a physical device that can't reach the auto-detected host, or a
# staging backend). Must include the /api prefix.
#
# Leave unset in most cases - src/constants/config.ts already resolves a
# working URL automatically for the Android emulator, iOS simulator, and
# physical devices on Expo Go/dev client (derived from Expo's own dev
# server host).
#
# Required in production builds (no auto-detection there).
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000/api
